        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nONE BEDROOM / ONE BATHROOM APARTMENT CANNON COURT, BRIDE STREET, DUBLIN 8 LOCATION COMING SOON!\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb one-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment to the rental market in the ever-popular Cannon Court development on Bride Street, Dublin 8.\nThis bright and well-presented apartment offers modern city living in a highly sought-after and convenient location. Cannon Court is ideally situated in the heart of Dublin 8 with a host of local amenities on your doorstep including cafés, restaurants, shops, St. Stephen's Green, and the vibrant city centre all within walking distance. The property also benefits from excellent transport links with multiple Dublin Bus routes nearby and easy access to Heuston Station and the wider road network.\nInternal accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, one generous double bedroom and a main bathroom. COMING SOON and viewing is highly advised.\nFeatures:\n<ul>\n <li>1 bedroom / 1 bathroom apartment</li>\n <li>Presented in excellent condition throughout</li>\n <li>Bright and spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Fully fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>One generous double bedroom</li>\n <li>Main bathroom</li>\n <li>Prime Dublin 8 city centre location</li>\n <li>Close to St. Stephen's Green & city centre</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links</li>\n <li>Walking distance to all amenities</li>\n <li>A host of local amenities nearby</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
